1
00:00:00,565 --> 00:00:04,442
HumanCOIN. Twelve thousand five hundred hours of human intent.

2
00:00:05,244 --> 00:00:07,361
A policy maps observation to action.

3
00:00:07,795 --> 00:00:10,974
But one frame precedes a lift, a pause, an

4
00:00:10,831 --> 00:00:13,101
