7
00:00:19,684 --> 00:00:22,579
It leaves traces. EEG before movement.

8
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,909
EMG before contact. Gaze before the hand.

9
00:00:26,677 --> 00:00:28,654
So we recorded three depths:

10
00:00:28,934 --> 00:00:32,544
ten thousand hours of attention, two thousand of exertion,

11
00:00:32,850 --> 00:00:36,256
five hundred of cognition, each inheriting the one below.

12
00:00:37,004 --> 00:00:41,226
One clock. Six views. Depth, point cloud, twenty joint

13
00:00:41,239 --> 00:00:42,132
