14
00:00:42,949 --> 00:00:47,643
Thirty-eight scenes, ninety-nine verbs, six hundred and thirty-five objects.

15
00:00:48,356 --> 00:00:51,736
Twenty-three asynchronous tables, aligned at query time.

16
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:55,496
Led by BAAI, with twenty-seven institutions.

17
00:00:56,228 --> 00:00:59,047
One command to install. Welcome to HumanCOIN.
